          <span\n                    \n                      class='px-6'\n                    \n                  >add to bag\n\n<div\n    class='\n      inline-flex gap-x-xs justify-start items-center group/price font-bold\n'\n    \n  >\n    <div class='inline-flex gap-x-2xs'><div class='group-[.on-sale]/price:hidden'><span class='sr-only'>Regular price</span>\n          <span class='font-bold font-bold'>\n            $108.00\n          </span></div>\n      <div class='hidden group-[.on-sale]/price:block'>\n        <span class='sr-only'>Sale price</span>\n        <span class='font-bold text-t-foreground lowercase font-bold hidden'>\n          free gift\n        </span>\n        <span class='font-bold text-t-foreground font-bold'>\n          $108.00\n        </span><span>\n            <s class='line-through text-[inherit] font-bold'>\n              $0.00\n            </s>\n          </span></div>\n      <small class='caption hidden'>\n        <span class='sr-only'>Unit price</span>\n        <span class='font-bold'>\n          <span></span>\n          <span aria-hidden='true'>/</span>\n          <span class='sr-only'>&nbsp;per&nbsp;</span>\n          <span>\n          </span>\n        </span>\n      </small>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</span>\n                </button>\n                \n                  <script id='attn-waitlist-eligibility' type='application/json'>\n  {\"42459592589394\":false}\n</script>\n<div id='attn-waitlist-trigger'></div>\n\n                \n              </div>\n            </div></div><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"product-id\" value=\"7593253470290\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"section-id\" value=\"template--16568793530450__main\" /></form></product-form>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .shopify-payment-button__more-options[aria-hidden='true'] {\n    display: none;\n  }\n</style>\n\n\n\n          \n            \n          \n        </div><div class='columns-1 lg:columns-2 text-body ' sub-section-id='claims_8UQ8Am'><p ><p><span class=\"metafield-multi_line_text_field\">🐰 Cruelty-free<br />\n💅 Special-edition<br />\n</span></p></p></div><div id=\"shopify-block-AZ3l5cTZQY1hPbys4Z__tolstoy_shoppable_video_ugc_stories_block_RH3tz6\" class=\"shopify-block shopify-app-block\"><tolstoy-stories\nclass=\"tolstoy-stories\"\ndata-tags=\"#.limit:5,#.products:PokemonLaunch,#.shipping:pokemon-restrict,071626,event:Pokemon Evees Evolution 2026,Pokemon,productsize:full,unittype:bundle,\"\ndata-publish-id=\"g1w7hu6osho9x\"\ndata-product-id=\"7593253470290\">\n</tolstoy-stories>\n\n\n</div><div class='accordion'  sub-section-id='description'>\n\n<div id='Details-description-template--16568793530450__main' class='group'>\n  <label\n    class='list-none block py-xs border-b-[currentColor] border-b cursor-pointer '\n    for='accordion-checkbox-description-template--16568793530450__main'\n  >\n    <input\n      aria-controls='accordion-content-description-template--16568793530450__main'\n      aria-labelled='Toggle product details accordion'\n      class='sr-only peer accordion-content-trigger'\n      type='checkbox'\n      id='accordion-checkbox-description-template--16568793530450__main'\n      name='accordion-input--description-template-16568793530450__main\n'\n      \n        checked\n      \n    >\n    <div class='flex items-center justify-between w-full peer-focus-visible:ring-1 ring-u-focus'>\n      <h3\n        class='text-body font-bold '\n        id='accordion-title-description-template--16568793530450__main'\n      >\n        product details\n      </h3>\n<svg-icon\n  src='icon-plus'\n  class='group-has-[:checked]:rotate-45 duration-300 transition-transform'\n\n  \n    style='--icon-size: 10px;'\n  \n\n  \n  \n></svg-icon>\n</div>\n  </label>\n  \n  \n  <div\n    class='rte group-has-[:checked]:grid-rows-[1fr] group-has-[:checked]:visible grid-rows-[0fr] transition-[visiblity,grid-template-rows] duration-300 grid invisible'\n    id='accordion-content-description-template--16568793530450__main'\n    role='region'\n    aria-labelledby='accordion-title-description-template--16568793530450__main'\n  >\n    <div class='overflow-hidden'>\n      <div class='pt-xs p '>\n        <p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Calling all Trainers: this one's for you. Grab the complete Pokémon x ColourPop: Eeveelution Collection in one collector-worthy set that celebrates Eevee and all eight of its evolutions. Every shade, every keychain charm, every evolution all yours.</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Set Includes:<br></span><span>- Eeveelution Eyeshadow Palette<br>- Eevee 3D Headband<br></span><span></span><span>- Fresh Kiss Glossy Lip Balm with Charm + Keychain Charm in Espeon: Sheer lilac (Taro Milk Tea flavor)<br></span><span>- Fresh Kiss Glossy Lip Balm with Charm + Keychain w/ Keychain Charm in Eevee: Sheer nude (Coconut Cream flavor)<br></span><span>- Fresh Kiss Glossy Lip Balm  with Charm + Keychain w/ Keychain Charm in Umbreon: Sheer black (Brown Sugar Boba flavor)<br></span><span>- Multichrome Shadow Stix in Flareon: Vivid tangerine with gold &amp; hot pink multichrome flip<br></span><span>- Multichrome Shadow Stix in Jolteon: Gold to copper to pink multichrome flip<br></span><span>- Multichrome Shadow Stix in Vaporeon: Bright aqua with gold duochrome flip<br></span><span>- BFF Liquid Liner in Leafeon: Pastel sage green<br></span><span>- BFF Liquid Liner in Glaceon: Pastel baby blue</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n          </div>\n\n\n\n<div class='accordion' sub-section-id='collapsible-row-1' >\n\n<div id='Details-collapsible-row-1-template--16568793530450__main' class='group'>\n  <label\n    class='list-none block py-xs border-b-[currentColor] border-b cursor-pointer '\n    for='accordion-checkbox-collapsible-row-1-template--16568793530450__main'\n  >\n    <input\n      aria-controls='accordion-content-collapsible-row-1-template--16568793530450__main'\n      aria-labelled='Toggle How to Use accordion'\n      class='sr-only peer accordion-content-trigger'\n      type='checkbox'\n      id='accordion-checkbox-collapsible-row-1-template--16568793530450__main'\n      name='accordion-input--collapsible-row-1-template-16568793530450__main\n'\n      \n    >\n    <div class='flex items-center justify-between w-full peer-focus-visible:ring-1 ring-u-focus'>\n      <h3\n        class='text-body font-bold '\n        id='accordion-title-collapsible-row-1-template--16568793530450__main'\n      >\n        How to Use\n      </h3>\n<svg-icon\n  src='icon-plus'\n  class='group-has-[:checked]:rotate-45 duration-300 transition-transform'\n\n  \n    style='--icon-size: 10px;'\n  \n\n  \n  \n></svg-icon>\n</div>\n  </label>\n  \n  \n  <div\n    class='rte group-has-[:checked]:grid-rows-[1fr] group-has-[:checked]:visible grid-rows-[0fr] transition-[visiblity,grid-template-rows] duration-300 grid invisible'\n    id='accordion-content-collapsible-row-1-template--16568793530450__main'\n    role='region'\n    aria-labelledby='accordion-title-collapsible-row-1-template--16568793530450__main'\n  >\n    <div class='overflow-hidden'>\n      <div class='pt-xs p '>\n        <p><span class=\"metafield-multi_line_text_field\">Eyeshadow Palette: Apply with your favourite shadow brushes. Flat and firmer brushes will give the most colour payoff. Fluffier brushes are great for blending. Fresh Kiss: Wear alone or layer over any lip colour for a sparkling, glazed finish.<br />\nMultichrome Shadow Stix: Swipe directly onto lids and blend with fingertips or a brush.<br />\nBFF Liquid Liner: Shake before use. Apply along your lash line or create your wings. Let dry completely. Glitterally Obsessed: Apply with fingertips or a brush to face, body + hair<br />\n</span></p>\n          \n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n          </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n\n  </main-product>\n\n\n\n\n\n</section><div id=\"shopify-section-template--16568793530450__product_bundle_items_RWUkLP\" class=\"shopify-section\"><!-- ##entry##component-product-ymal##endentry## -->\n\n<bundle-products\n    class='bundle-products'\n  ></bundle-products>\n</div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--16568793530450__product_recommendations_QgpqUa\" class=\"shopify-section\"><!-- ##entry##component-product-recommendations##endentry## -->\n<product-recommendations\n  class='product-recommendations'\n  data-url='/recommendations/products?section_id=template--16568793530450__product_recommendations_QgpqUa&product_id=7593253470290&limit=8&intent=complementary'\n></product-recommendations>\n\n\n</div><section id=\"shopify-section-template--16568793530450__image_banner_9gbhGq\" class=\"shopify-section\">\n\n<div class='block whitespace-nowrap overflow-clip w-full md:h-fit h-fit'>\n  \n  <div class='relative w-full md:h-fit h-fit'><div class='inset-0 w-full !h-full py-4 absolute md:h-fit h-fit !bg-p-lightest'></div>\n    \n\n    <div class='text-p-lightest justify-items-start text-start items-center relative h-full inset-0 w-100 px-4 lg:px-10 py-10 grid grid-cols-1'>\n      <div class='grid whitespace-normal grid-cols-1 max-w-md\tjustify-items-start text-start items-center'>\n        \n        \n</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  \n</div>\n\n\n</section><div id=\"shopify-section-template--16568793530450__product_recommendations_iiDfEA\" class=\"shopify-section\"><!-- ##entry##component-product-recommendations##endentry## -->\n<product-recommendations\n  class='product-recommendations'\n  data-url='/recommendations/products?section_id=template--16568793530450__product_recommendations_iiDfEA&product_id=7593253470290&limit=8&intent=related'\n></product-recommendations>\n\n\n</div><div id=\"shopify-section-template--16568793530450__17835351371716d6b8\" class=\"shopify-section\"><div\n  \n>\n  <div\n    class='\n      px-pagemargin\n      2xl:container\n      sm:py-0 py-0\n    '\n  >\n    \n<div id=\"shopify-block-AZUZuWkxCLzEzVGdDc__nosto_nosto_placements_block_7dydGK\" class=\"shopify-block shopify-app-block\"><div class=\"nosto_element\" id=\"productpage-nosto